# Recommended: copy this file to the repo root as `.env` (cp .env.example .env) and fill it in.
# The root npm scripts (npm run dev / agent / agent:context / agent:harness) load it through
# tools/with-env.sh, so one file feeds all four processes. Environment variables override
# `dotnet user-secrets`, and Next.js prefers them over frontend/.env.local.
#
# Minimal root .env:
#   OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
#   OPENAI_TRANSCRIPTION_API_KEY=${OPENAI_API_KEY}
#   CPK_INTELLIGENCE_API_KEY=cpk-...
#
# The per-project alternatives below (user-secrets, frontend/.env.local) still work.

# Copy each value to where it is read. Never commit the filled-in files.

# ── backend/, backend/agent-app-context/ and backend/harness/ ──────────────
# Read with builder.Configuration["OPENAI_API_KEY"] (the Quickstart's code). Set it
# per project with user-secrets (preferred, as the Quickstart does):
#   cd backend/quickstart && dotnet user-secrets set OPENAI_API_KEY "sk-..."
#   cd backend/agent-app-context && dotnet user-secrets set OPENAI_API_KEY "sk-..."
#   cd backend/harness && dotnet user-secrets set OPENAI_API_KEY "sk-..."
# or export it in the shell that runs `dotnet run`.
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# ── frontend/.env.local ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Read by the Quickstart runtime (app/api/copilotkit/[[...slug]]/route.ts) and by the
# Agent App Context runtime. Required: both construct CopilotKitIntelligence with it.
# Get one with `npx copilotkit@latest project select` (writes it to .env), or at
# https://dashboard.operations.copilotkit.ai.
CPK_INTELLIGENCE_API_KEY=cpk-...

# For /voice. Read by the Voice page's transcription-service.ts (OpenAI transcription in the Node
# runtime). Without it the runtime advertises no transcription and the mic button never appears.
# OPENAI_TRANSCRIPTION_API_KEY=sk-...

# Optional. Read by the showcase runtime (app/api/copilotkit-showcase/route.ts).
# Defaults to http://localhost:8000.
# AGENT_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Optional. Base URL of backend/harness, read by the Harness-agent routes
# (copilotkit-showcase-harness, -mcp-apps, -ogui, -declarative-*, -a2ui-fixed-schema).
# Defaults to http://localhost:8002.
# HARNESS_AGENT_URL=http://localhost:8002

# Optional. Opt out of CopilotKit runtime telemetry.
# COPILOTKIT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=true
